Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.81,0:21:22.52,ED2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord1\3c&H606060&}甘い　甘い
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.81,0:21:22.52,ED2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1c&HFFBBAA&\3c&HFF6E43&\bord3.5\blur2.5\1a&H55&}甘い　{\1c&HFE9CFD&\3c&HFD10FE&}甘い
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.52,0:21:23.81,ED2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\bord1\3c&H606060&}その体で受け止めてね
